  "notes": "Previs tool 'Blockout' with near-black zinc UI and a single amber (#f5a524) active/primary color (SHOOT mode, Play shot, Apply move, selected lens/rig). Uses film vocabulary as controls (WS/FS/MS/MCU/CU, 2-SHOT, OTS, DUTCH). Emoji used as icons in buttons. Floating 'SHOT PREVIEW' picture-in-picture shows the camera's framed view inside the 3D viewport. Character tracks are color-coded (MAYA red, DEX blue) matching floor marks and paths in the 3D scene. HUD chip strip in monospace at top-left of viewport. Codebook lacks a 3D scene/previs editor entry; proposed as scene-editor-3d."
